<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-10-31T18:40:50.875Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 18:40:50 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab intensified assaults on Somali army positions in Lower Shabelle, killing a former al-Shabaab finance chief and raising the army toll, while Somali forces reported recapturing about 55% of territory previously held by al-Shabaab and ISIS. African Union troops are withdrawing from four bases in Lower Shabelle and Ethiopia is pulling more than 3,000 troops from Somalia, reducing external military presence. Somalia agreed to acquire Pakistani JF-17 fighter jets and the UAE carried out its first drone strike against al-Shabaab in nearly a year. Piracy off Somalia’s coast is rising with hijacked oil tankers and hostages reported. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNSE84VGhwOGdhbkZGY1NNQXBYUURlSlRXMTF2ZWk2VmQ1MEhWTEJwTndFcFZwMUx2Uzk2cjNrN1VpMmFKU0pudkE2cEJ3cEllbkI1cHlJZG44SzdSekd2ay05NmROTzloY19LMXBBMVI1OXVLaXdzSW5lRk5IZVkzMXJ6aERNeXJTdlRJU2kwaHV0SUdfRElCRA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxPNzdxT0hGaF8yc29NbWhvQWJvcXEyLXNPTVMtOE9sSTNDMEYyNXNfVXowTGJaaGdSbFNtNnR3ZjBTTGt5Ry1PQnNRbHlSWG9OZFprY0p3SXhUYzlTQ05HYjYxQmk0dnA3ZjcyOFVlb0Q1azItTVFja3ZEVFdYdFhQaTQyZDYyWW5nXzktMm43Y3dDQXBvekJxc0xMMkM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Oman Observer&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQT1ZIbGhsZVJ4WmdXZ1E4Q1NKZkxsaV9jM3J0N3lvRVpobk9FcXY2dU5NVm5YMDd5TVpHMmFTOXQyblR0S3ZTblM0aXo2LTFaWFlQWnlzLXNVTVFRTlhIaC1tX2NxRVliNERScnpjQUpMOFdGOEdzMkFhUklnUVBVNTBqVklFM0k4M1lMMEFvd29qLWE0cWhpZHJ2bi1SclJGc1gxd3VuUTQweEVaNlZFVTg0RDVYLXVFVnc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;, &l